# scripts/reference-pass.sh writes one directory per run, and most of it is
# 570 MB of DerivedData and SwiftPM caches. Untracked, it also made the script
# stamp its own record "WORKING TREE DIRTY" — the pass reporting that it is not
# evidence about the commit it just measured. Commit a record worth keeping
# with `git add -f reference-pass/<run>/REFERENCE-PASS.md`.
reference-pass/
